# Small blast radius (implementation only)

1. Implement with the **smallest code change** that meets the current micro-todo / AC.
2. No drive-by refactors; reuse existing modules; keep engine/OpenAPI untouched unless the plan requires it.
3. **Does not** mean fewer plan todos — plans stay micro + `[REQ]`/`[AC]`/`[TEST]`/`[EDGE]` per `plan-todos-quadruples`.
